{"name":"Waiting","hex":"#9d9d9d","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"waiting","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["present participle and gerund of wait"]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Watching, observation; keeping watch, guarding.","The act of staying or remaining in expectation."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/waiting"}],"entries":[{"title":"Waiting (Degas)","blocks":[{"text":"Waiting is a pastel on paper by the French Impressionist Edgar Degas, completed between 1880–1882. It is an early example of the more than 200 pastels, paintings, mixed media drawings and sculptures of ballerinas depicted by Degas from the early 1880s. This work is regarded for its vibrant colouring and steep perspective."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/Edgar_Degas_-_Waiting_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg/330px-Edgar_Degas_-_Waiting_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Waiting_(Degas)","wikidata":"Q7960534"},{"title":"Waiting (Millais)","blocks":[{"text":"Waiting or Girl at the Stile or A Girl at a Stile or The Stile is an 1854 oil painting by the English artist John Everett Millais. It shows a woman in a dress, shawl and bonnet sitting on a wooden stile over a dry stone field wall, with woods beyond. She is looking to her left, as if in anticipation."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c3/John_Everett_Millais_%281829-1896%29_-_Waiting_-_1909P62_-_Birmingham_Museums_Trust.jpg/330px-John_Everett_Millais_%281829-1896%29_-_Waiting_-_1909P62_-_Birmingham_Museums_Trust.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Waiting_(Millais)","wikidata":"Q98148407"},{"title":"Waiting (2015 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Waiting is a 2015 Indian Hindi-language drama film directed by Anu Menon. Produced by Priti Gupta and Manish Mundra under the banner of Ishka Films and Drishyam Films respectively, the film was co-written by Menon and James Ruzicka, and stars Naseeruddin Shah and Kalki Koechlin. Waiting focuses on the relationship between two people from different walks of life who befriend each other in a hospital, while nursing their respective comatose spouses. Rajat Kapoor, Suhasini Maniratnam, Arjun Mathur, Ratnabali Bhattacharjee and Rajeev Ravindranathan play supporting roles in the film."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/3/33/Waiting_%282015%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Waiting_(2015_film)","wikidata":"Q22905783"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ce/Edgar_Germain_Hilaire_Degas_024.jpg/500px-Edgar_Germain_Hilaire_Degas_024.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ce/Edgar_Germain_Hilaire_Degas_024.jpg/1280px-Edgar_Germain_Hilaire_Degas_024.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ce/Edgar_Germain_Hilaire_Degas_024.jpg/500px-Edgar_Germain_Hilaire_Degas_024.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Three Dancers in an Exercise Hall, 1880, Degas, Oil on canvas","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AEdgar_Germain_Hilaire_Degas_024.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0a/Degas_-_Ersch%C3%B6pfte_T%C3%A4nzerin.jpg/500px-Degas_-_Ersch%C3%B6pfte_T%C3%A4nzerin.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0a/Degas_-_Ersch%C3%B6pfte_T%C3%A4nzerin.jpg/500px-Degas_-_Ersch%C3%B6pfte_T%C3%A4nzerin.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Dancer Stretching, c 1882–1885., Degas, Pastel on paper. 46.7 x 29.7 cm. Kimbell Art Museum, Fort Worth, Texas","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADegas_-_Ersch%C3%B6pfte_T%C3%A4nzerin.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c1/Chinese_Fishing_Nets_with_Blue_Cloudy_Sky_in_Background_at_Fort_Kochi%2C_Kerala%2C_India.jpg/500px-Chinese_Fishing_Nets_with_Blue_Cloudy_Sky_in_Background_at_Fort_Kochi%2C_Kerala%2C_India.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c1/Chinese_Fishing_Nets_with_Blue_Cloudy_Sky_in_Background_at_Fort_Kochi%2C_Kerala%2C_India.jpg/500px-Chinese_Fishing_Nets_with_Blue_Cloudy_Sky_in_Background_at_Fort_Kochi%2C_Kerala%2C_India.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Filming took place primarily in the coastal town of Kochi, Kerala.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AChinese_Fishing_Nets_with_Blue_Cloudy_Sky_in_Background_at_Fort_Kochi%2C_Kerala%2C_India.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/71/Kalki_Koechlin_and_Naseeruddin_Shah_at_the_premiere_of_%27Waiting%27.jpg/330px-Kalki_Koechlin_and_Naseeruddin_Shah_at_the_premiere_of_%27Waiting%27.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/71/Kalki_Koechlin_and_Naseeruddin_Shah_at_the_premiere_of_%27Waiting%27.jpg/330px-Kalki_Koechlin_and_Naseeruddin_Shah_at_the_premiere_of_%27Waiting%27.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Kalki Koechlin (right) and Naseeruddin Shah were chiefly praised for their performances.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AKalki_Koechlin_and_Naseeruddin_Shah_at_the_premiere_of_'Waiting'.jpg"}],"sounds":{"waiting":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/76/En-us-waiting.ogg?utm_source=en.wikti